{"v":[{"a":["أَلَمۡ","نَشۡرَحۡ","لَكَ","صَدۡرَكَ"],"t":"Did We not soothe your heart","l":"Alam Nashrah Laka Sadraka","w":[["alam","Have not"],["nashraḥ","We expanded"],["laka","for you"],["ṣadraka","your breast"]]},{"a":["وَوَضَعۡنَا","عَنكَ","وِزۡرَكَ"],"t":"And lift from you your burden","l":"Wa Wađa`na `Anka Wizraka","w":[["wawaḍaʿnā","And We removed"],["ʿanka","from you"],["wiz'raka","your burden"]]},{"a":["ٱلَّذِيٓ","أَنقَضَ","ظَهۡرَكَ"],"t":"Which weighed down your back","l":"Al-Ladhi 'Anqađa Zahraka","w":[["alladhī","Which"],["anqaḍa","weighed upon"],["ẓahraka","your back"]]},{"a":["وَرَفَعۡنَا","لَكَ","ذِكۡرَكَ"],"t":"And raised for you your reputation","l":"Wa Rafa`na Laka Dhikraka","w":[["warafaʿnā","And We raised high"],["laka","for you"],["dhik'raka","your reputation"]]},{"a":["فَإِنَّ","مَعَ","ٱلۡعُسۡرِ","يُسۡرًا"],"t":"With hardship comes ease","l":"Fa'inna Ma`a Al-`Usri Yusraan","w":[["fa-inna","So indeed"],["maʿa","with"],["l-ʿus'ri","the hardship"],["yus'ran","(is) ease"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","مَعَ","ٱلۡعُسۡرِ","يُسۡرٗا"],"t":"With hardship comes ease","l":"Inna Ma`a Al-`Usri Yusraan","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["maʿa","with"],["l-ʿus'ri","the hardship"],["yus'ran","(is) ease"]]},{"a":["فَإِذَا","فَرَغۡتَ","فَٱنصَبۡ"],"t":"When your work is done, turn to devotion","l":"Fa'idha Faraghta Fansab","w":[["fa-idhā","So when"],["faraghta","you have finished"],["fa-inṣab","then labor hard"]]},{"a":["وَإِلَىٰ","رَبِّكَ","فَٱرۡغَب"],"t":"And to your Lord turn for everything","l":"Wa 'Ila Rabbika Farghab","w":[["wa-ilā","And to"],["rabbika","your Lord"],["fa-ir'ghab","turn your attention"]]}]}